      "id": 1,
      "text": "Campbellsburg was founded as Chiltonsville in 1840, named for trustee Charles J. Chilton, but the name changed within three weeks to honor a local family.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
